/* ============================================================
   JIMRAMI — STANDARD ROUND COUNT MODE POLISH V4

   Put this AFTER the older Standard Round polish blocks.
   It intentionally overrides V1/V2.

   V4
   - same 1 × 4 count-card layout in webapp, landscape and portrait
   - compact calculator stays BESIDE the cards on tablet portrait
   - calculator has its own cool-blue visual language
   - tiny neutral 0 shortcut lives inside each player card
   - completed values slide into score order even when tied
   - normal awards use ScoreTransition green: +3 / +2 / +1 / 0
   - a valid 2nd/3rd tie becomes +3 / +2 / +2 / 0
   - that middle tie reuses the Quick Rank purple TIED language
   - tie dialog gets a close button
   - tie dialog now enters/exits with a soft fade + spring
   - exact 3rd/4th 0–0 tie stays as a purple tie, no decider
============================================================ */

